 "defend": true,
 "desc": "A prototype mobile suit for Newtypes, personally designed by Amuro Ray of One Year War fame.\nThis machine was designed based on generations of Gundam-type data and equipped with the best technology available at the time.\nIt has incredible responsiveness due to its partial use of psycho-frame, a revolutionary material that incorporates computer chips with basic psycommu functionality.\nOn its back are fin funnels, special Newtype weapons controlled through psycommu to unleash all-range attacks.\nCombining three or more fin funnels allows them to be used as a beam weapon-nullifying I-Field generator, and thus these high-performance weapons combine both attack and defense.",
